<title>BRAZIL: Brazil BR Distribuidora Jan-July net down.</title>
<headline>Brazil BR Distribuidora Jan-July net down.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian fuel distributor BR Petrobras Distribuidora S.A. released the following figures for 1996's first seven months.</p>
<p>		   Jan-July 1996	    Jan-July 1995</p>
<p>    Net	     $74.7 million		   $138.8 million</p>
<p>    Gross sales   $4.926 bln		  $4.727 bln</p>
<p>    Net worth     $1.128			   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: All the figures are in U.S dollars.</p>
<p>The firm also said in a statement that profitability over net worth was 7.1 percent in the January-July period versus 15.5 percent in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 232 4411</p>
</text>
